Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Reaction Scheme for Successive Substrate Binding", "Subsection",
 GeneratedCell->True,
 CellAutoOverwrite->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9847218366604548`*^9},
 CellTags->
  "SuccessiveBinding",ExpressionUUID->"51ffe1b3-f7fa-4bc0-b6ae-1bf8b08f09f8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Let us consider an enzyme with n substrate binding sites (for example, an \
oligomeric enzyme). For our initial considerations, the arrangement of the \
subunits is irrelevant, and the sites are occupied by substrate randomly. \
Then, an enzyme with n binding sites is modeled to bind the substrate in a \
stepwise fashion as follows:\n",
