  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["cES", "i"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "420241f5-a2d9-444e-abea-7faab8380a2d"],
 " is the concentration of the enzyme-substrate complex with i ligands, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["k", 
    RowBox[{"p", ",", "i"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5e922ccb-f5a4-4897-8da8-9352ba183962"],
 " the catalytic constant of the complex with i bound substrate molecules."
}], "Text",
