Cell["\<\
1. Segel, I. H. Enzyme Kinetics. (Wiley, 1975), p. 358 ff
2. Adair, G. S., Bock, A. V. & Field, H., Jr. J. Biol. Chem. 63, \
529\[Dash]545 (1925).
3. Pauling, L. Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. 21, 186\[Dash]191 (1935).\
\>", "Text",
