 "This is the Hill equation with K\[CloseCurlyQuote]:= ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["K", "S", "n"], " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      UnderoverscriptBox["\[Product]", 
